{"version":1,"content":"<p>《俠盜獵車6》發售在即，各大線下門店已經開始陳列遊戲的空包裝盒。PS5版本的實體包裝，在11月12日官方允許開售之前，就已提前流出到市面。今日早些時候，Reddit子版塊「GTA6未分級討論區」出現了一批塑封完好的PS5版實體盒照片，發帖者據稱是德國的一名零售從業者。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1585490.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.605146+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T12:31:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"1f6b2dabe1fd6f83f916b961d8e4fdd3ac37dc01cfb74397aa3fcc4dcf78be6c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}